# Tor SOCKS proxy for SearXNG egress — routes engine requests through
# rotating Tor exit IPs so upstream engines (Bing/Brave/Startpage/…) stop
# fingerprinting and banning our single datacenter IP. Keyless.
# See docs: 2026-08-01 doc_search retrieval rework.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice stdout
ClientOnly 1
# If the local network blocks Tor itself, uncomment bridges + pluggable
# transports (obfs4/snowflake) — see config/tor/torrc.bridges.example.
